Name Easter Note - Bravo #1


Interactability_Text_Line_0 Log: 14/4/17 - Research Outpost: Bravo
Interactability_Text_Line_1 ------
Interactability_Text_Line_2 Finally a new import came in today. It’s been weeks since a ship has come through here. Hell must be rising on the mainland in order for us to not have any supplies. Looks like as usual we’ll be forgotten in the midst of all of this. But for now, we get back to SCIENCE!